  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Bering Sea Water Temperatures (1977-1989)",
  "description": "Water temperature data were collected in the Bering Sea during MIZEX West, OCSEAP, and FOCI deployments, from 1977 to 1989. These data are stored on 74 disk files (8.1 MB) at the Pacific Marine Environmental Laboratory in Seattle, Washington. NOAAServer Codes: [L 75 56 -160 -180] ; nodateline\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To collect and record water temperature data in the Bering Sea during MIZEX West, OCSEAP, and FOCI deployments, from 1977 to 1989.",
